  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/sedatus-biterrensis/pl72_37_sa#PL72.SA.1.s2",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/sedatus-biterrensis/pl72_37_sa",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.SA.1.s2",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Illud, fratres charissimi, quod die tertia nuptiæ factae sunt, hoc, quod aquam in vinum con­ versam fuisse, modo cum Evangelium legeretur, au­ distis.",
    "chunk_index": 11,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 589,
    "date_range": [
      589,
      589
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/sedatus-biterrensis/pl72_37_sa#PL72.SA.1.s3",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/sedatus-biterrensis/pl72_37_sa",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.SA.1.s3",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Sex autem hydriae sunt sex mundi hujus æta­ tes, per quas justi figuram et typum Domini praetu­ lerant.",
    "chunk_index": 12,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 589,
    "date_range": [
      589,
