    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/sedatus-biterrensis/pl72_37_sa#PL72.SA.1.s4",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/sedatus-biterrensis/pl72_37_sa",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.SA.1.s4",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Capiunt metretas binas, vel ternas, quia fi­ dem intra se continent Trinitatis. Sed videamus quid dicit sermo divinus, et ipsa sacri Evangelii tracte­ mus oracula.",
    "chunk_index": 13,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 589,
    "date_range": [
      589,
      589
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/sedatus-biterrensis/pl72_37_sa#PL72.SA.1.s5",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/sedatus-biterrensis/pl72_37_sa",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.SA.1.s5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "In Cana Galilææ aquas in vina con­ vertit, et latentem sub homine Deum operum virtute detexit. Et die, inquit, tertia nuptiæ fiebant.",
    "chunk_index": 14,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 589,
    "date_range": [
      589,
      589
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/sedatus-biterrensis/pl72_37_sa#PL72.SA.1.s6",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/sedatus-biterrensis/pl72_37_sa",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.SA.1.s6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Quae sunt istae nuptiæ. nisi gaudia salutis humanae? quare die tertia, nisi quia die tertia resurrexit ?",
    "chunk_index": 15,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 589,
    "date_range": [
      589,
      589
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/sedatus-biterrensis/pl72_37_sa#PL72.SA.1.s7",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/sedatus-biterrensis/pl72_37_sa",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.SA.1.s7",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Itaque tan­ quam sponsus procedens de thalamo suo descendit ad terras, Ecclesiae ex gentibus congregandæ, incar­ natione jungendas.",
    "chunk_index": 16,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 589,
    "date_range": [
      589,
      589
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/sedatus-biterrensis/pl72_37_sa#PL72.SA.1.s8",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/sedatus-biterrensis/pl72_37_sa",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.SA.1.s8",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Cui quidem et hujus Ecclesiæ , quae utique sumo! nos, et arrhas, et dotcm dedit.",
    "chunk_index": 17,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 589,
    "date_range": [
      589,
      589
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/sedatus-biterrensis/pl72_37_sa#PL72.SA.1.s9",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/sedatus-biterrensis/pl72_37_sa",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.SA.1.s9",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Arrhas dedit, qunndo nobis est ex lege promis­ sus. Dotem dedit, quando pro nubis est Immolatus.",
    "chunk_index": 18,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 589,
    "date_range": [
      589,
      589
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/sedatus-biterrensis/pl72_37_sa#PL72.SA.2.s1",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/sedatus-biterrensis/pl72_37_sa",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.SA.2.s1",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Et alio modo hoc potest accipi, ut arrhas, prae­ sentem gratiam, dotem Intelligamus vitam aeternam. Videamus quid agit in Chanaam Galilææ.",
    "chunk_index": 19,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 589,
    "date_range": [
      589,
      589
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/sedatus-biterrensis/pl72_37_sa#PL72.SA.2.s2",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/sedatus-biterrensis/pl72_37_sa",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.SA.2.s2",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Hic jam prodant nobis Deum stupenda miracula. Statuuntur hydriae capientes metretas binas, vel ternas.",
    "chunk_index": 20,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 589,
    "date_range": [
      589,
      589
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/sedatus-biterrensis/pl72_37_sa#PL72.SA.2.s3",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/sedatus-biterrensis/pl72_37_sa",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.SA.2.s3",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Implen­ tur hydriæ, mutantur subito aquæ, homines postmo­ dum maturi dum in melius reformantur, velut ba­ ptismate vini liquantur quodammodo;",
    "chunk_index": 21,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 589,
    "date_range": [
      589,
      589
    ],
