    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/sedatus-biterrensis/pl72_37_sa#PL72.SA.2.s5",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/sedatus-biterrensis/pl72_37_sa",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.SA.2.s5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Jam primo loco requiramus quod sit vinum quod defecisse dicitur, et quod sit aliud vi­ num quod mirabiliter praeparatur, quod archi­ triclinus melius esse pronuntiat ibidem diceos :",
    "chunk_index": 23,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 589,
    "date_range": [
      589,
      589
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/sedatus-biterrensis/pl72_37_sa#PL72.SA.2.s6",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/sedatus-biterrensis/pl72_37_sa",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.SA.2.s6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Omnis homo primum vinum bonum pontt, et cum in­ ebriati fuerint, tunc id quod deterius est. Tu vero ser­ vasti vinum bonum usque nunc.",
    "chunk_index": 24,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 589,
    "date_range": [
      589,
      589
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/sedatus-biterrensis/pl72_37_sa#PL72.SA.2.s7",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/sedatus-biterrensis/pl72_37_sa",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.SA.2.s7",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Vinum multis locis accepimus divina praecepta et Scripturas sanctas, me­ racissimum vigorem cœlestis sapientiæ continentes, quibus ad timerem Dei incalescat sensus, et inebrie­ tur affectus.",
    "chunk_index": 25,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 589,
    "date_range": [
      589,
      589
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/sedatus-biterrensis/pl72_37_sa#PL72.SA.3.s1",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/sedatus-biterrensis/pl72_37_sa",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.SA.3.s1",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Secundum illud, quod de Sapientia dictum est : Paravit mensam suam, miscuit vinum suum in cratere.",
    "chunk_index": 26,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 589,
    "date_range": [
      589,
      589
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/sedatus-biterrensis/pl72_37_sa#PL72.SA.3.s2",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/sedatus-biterrensis/pl72_37_sa",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.SA.3.s2",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Scripturarum ergo divinarum virtus, si quando ali­ cujus interiora repleverit, dicere poterit cum Pro­ pheta (Psalm.",
    "chunk_index": 27,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 589,
    "date_range": [
      589,
      589
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/sedatus-biterrensis/pl72_37_sa#PL72.SA.3.s3",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/sedatus-biterrensis/pl72_37_sa",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.SA.3.s3",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "LIX) : Potasti noi vino compunctionis, et populum tuum inebrians quam præclarum est!",
    "chunk_index": 28,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 589,
    "date_range": [
      589,
      589
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/sedatus-biterrensis/pl72_37_sa#PL72.SA.3.s4",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/sedatus-biterrensis/pl72_37_sa",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.SA.3.s4",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Ope­ rante ergo Christo in Cana Galileae, vinum defecit, et vinum fit, id est, umbrae removentur, et veritas praesentatur.",
    "chunk_index": 29,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 589,
    "date_range": [
      589,
      589
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/sedatus-biterrensis/pl72_37_sa#PL72.SA.3.s5",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/sedatus-biterrensis/pl72_37_sa",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.SA.3.s5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Recedit lex, gratia succedIt. Carnalia in spiritualia commutantur.",
    "chunk_index": 30,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 589,
    "date_range": [
      589,
      589
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/sedatus-biterrensis/pl72_37_sa#PL72.SA.3.s6",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/sedatus-biterrensis/pl72_37_sa",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.SA.3.s6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "In novum Testamentum observatio vetusta transfunditur; sicut beatus Apo­ stolus dicit ( II Cor. III) : Vetera transierunt, et ecce facta sunt nova.",
    "chunk_index": 31,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 589,
    "date_range": [
      589,
      589
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/sedatus-biterrensis/pl72_37_sa#PL72.SA.3.s7",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/sedatus-biterrensis/pl72_37_sa",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.SA.3.s7",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Quomodo autem hydrite illæ implatæ aqua nihil minuunt ex eo quod erant, ita lex non perit per adventum Christi dissoluta, sed proficit.",
    "chunk_index": 32,
    "context_before": null,
